# Cross-repo links carry the <adopter-org> placeholder until setup-org.md step 3
# substitutes it. Ignore only the unsubstituted form; once substituted, the URLs
# are real and link-check verifies them.
#
# Matched WITHOUT the angle brackets on purpose: lychee percent-encodes them
# before matching, so the URI it tests reads %3Cadopter-org%3E. A pattern
# containing literal < or > is silently inert.
adopter-org
